You are an expert full-stack web developer and UI/UX designer. Build a complete, responsive Single-Page Application (SPA) in modern React (with Tailwind CSS and Lucide React icons) for the **Institute of Technology of Cambodia (ITC) - International Engineering School** timetable management and schedule viewing system.

### App Overview & Objective
Build an interactive academic dashboard for Semester 1 (Weeks 1–8, Academic Year 2026–2027) covering all 3 Cohorts / Generations (I2, I3, I4) across 7 Groups:
- **Generation I2:** `I2-SE`, `I2-AIECS`, `I2-CMIE`
- **Generation I3:** `I3-SE`, `I3-AIECS`
- **Generation I4:** `I4-SE`, `I4-AIECS`

---

### Core Features & Views

1. **Header & Quick Stats:**
   - Institution Branding: "Institute of Technology of Cambodia - International Engineering School".
   - Current Date & Time indicator (Cambodia UTC+7) with a "Live / In Session" badge for classes happening right now.
   - Quick stats cards: Total Groups (7), Cohorts (3), Total Lecturers, Active Rooms.

2. **Multi-Mode Navigation:**
   - **Mode A: By Group / Cohort (Primary Timetable View):**
     - Cohort tab switcher (All, I2, I3, I4) + Group pills (`I2-SE`, `I2-AIECS`, `I2-CMIE`, `I3-SE`, `I3-AIECS`, `I4-SE`, `I4-AIECS`).
     - Display a full weekly timetable matrix (Monday through Saturday) with standard slots:
       - Morning: `7h00 - 7h55`, `8h00 - 8h55`, `9h10 - 10h05`, `10h10 - 11h05`
       - Afternoon: `13h00 - 13h55`, `14h00 - 14h55`, `15h10 - 16h05`, `16h10 - 17h05`
     - Clean card blocks for each session showing: Course Name, Session Type badge (`Lecture`, `Practical`, `TP`, `Tutorial`), Instructor name, and Room badge.
   - **Mode B: By Lecturer:**
     - Dropdown / search to select an instructor (e.g., Mr. PICH Reatrey, Dr. KUY Movsun, Mr. TAL Tongsreng, etc.) to view their consolidated weekly teaching schedule across groups.
   - **Mode C: By Room / Laboratory:**
     - Select a room (`A-109`, `A-401`, `A-417`, `A-420`, `A-402`, `J-601`, `J-602`, `J-603`, `J-609`) to see occupancy and available free slots.
   - **Mode D: Today's Agenda (Daily View):**
     - Select any day of the week (or auto-default to today) for a streamlined timeline view.

3. **Color Coding & Visual Hierarchy:**
   - **Lecture:** Indigo / Blue tint
   - **Practical / TP:** Emerald / Green tint
   - **Tutorial:** Amber / Orange tint
   - High-contrast, clean typography, rounded corners, subtle shadows, and dark/light mode toggle.

4. **Utilities:**
   - Search bar (instantly highlights matches by course name, lecturer, or room).
   - "Print Schedule / Export PDF" button formatted with `@media print` rules.

